<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.360" end="00:00:03.000" style="s2">And now you think you can walk into my</p>
<p begin="00:00:01.800" end="00:00:05.000" style="s2">engagement celebration [music] wearing</p>
<p begin="00:00:03.000" end="00:00:06.040" style="s2">that dress and pretend to be his mother?</p>
<p begin="00:00:05.000" end="00:00:07.205" style="s2">Are you not one of those ladies who</p>
<p begin="00:00:06.040" end="00:00:07.640" style="s2">wants to steal my man?</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.205" end="00:00:10.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.640" end="00:00:13.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t need to pretend to be anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.160" end="00:00:13.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are a liar.</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.440" end="00:00:16.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have offered you an explanation.</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.065" end="00:00:18.240" style="s2">[music] You have chosen to insult me</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.560" end="00:00:20.560" style="s2">instead.</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.240" end="00:00:22.270" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out of my way.</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.560" end="00:00:24.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will not leave until I speak to my</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.270" end="00:00:26.600" style="s2">[music] son.</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.440" end="00:00:30.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You will not ruin this day for me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.600" end="00:00:30.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then stop ruining it yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.370" end="00:00:37.390" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.955" end="00:00:41.975" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.195" end="00:00:47.215" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.960" end="00:00:56.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.680" end="00:00:58.600" style="s2">I don&#39;t want another meeting</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.640" end="00:01:01.600" style="s2">where everybody agrees with me and</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.600" end="00:01:01.600" style="s2">nothing changes.</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.640" end="00:01:07.760" style="s2">If the figures don&#39;t support the</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.080" end="00:01:08.480" style="s2">proposal, reject it.</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.760" end="00:01:11.840" style="s2">I don&#39;t care [music] whose</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.480" end="00:01:11.840" style="s2">recommendation it carries.</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.320" end="00:01:31.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know, most men would have come to</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.840" end="00:01:31.360" style="s2">meet their fiance by now.</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.480" end="00:01:36.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought you were still getting ready.</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.360" end="00:01:41.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was.</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.120" end="00:01:43.240" style="s2">Then I remembered</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.200" end="00:01:46.360" style="s2">I was coming to see you,</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.240" end="00:01:46.360" style="s2">not the president.</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.960" end="00:01:51.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.280" end="00:01:51.240" style="s2">Work ran late.</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.351" end="00:01:53.371" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.160" end="00:01:59.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You work too much. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.360" end="00:02:01.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You You that when you agreed to marry</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.452" end="00:02:01.732" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.001" end="00:02:13.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.612" end="00:02:25.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Speaking of marriage,</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.332" end="00:02:26.612" style="s2">my planner called again.</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.212" end="00:02:29.932" style="s2">She needs confirmation [music] for the</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.612" end="00:02:29.932" style="s2">final guest list.</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.092" end="00:02:35.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Send it to my office.</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.132" end="00:02:35.892" style="s2">Adrian can review the arrangements.</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.652" end="00:02:41.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian?</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.612" end="00:02:45.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s coordinating [music] the corporate</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.892" end="00:02:47.092" style="s2">guests.</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.532" end="00:02:50.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, this is our engagement</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.092" end="00:02:52.732" style="s2">celebration, not a board meeting.</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.932" end="00:02:54.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know, right?</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.732" end="00:02:56.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then act like it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.212" end="00:02:57.852" style="s2">Nothing is wrong. I simply don&#39;t want to</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.052" end="00:02:59.652" style="s2">spend the next 2 weeks chasing people</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.852" end="00:03:02.572" style="s2">for confirmations</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.652" end="00:03:04.532" style="s2">while you sit [music] in meetings.</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.572" end="00:03:07.772" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You won&#39;t have to. I&#39;ll make sure the</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.532" end="00:03:07.772" style="s2">arrangements are handled.</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.212" end="00:03:14.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s better.</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.812" end="00:03:27.212" style="s2">By the way, I saw the [music] new house</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.532" end="00:03:31.052" style="s2">on Banana Island.</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.212" end="00:03:33.812" style="s2">The one with the private waterfront.</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.052" end="00:03:33.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about it?</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.932" end="00:03:38.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.132" end="00:03:39.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I haven&#39;t seen it.</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.212" end="00:03:40.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should.</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.532" end="00:03:43.932" style="s2">A house like [music] that would be</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.732" end="00:03:43.932" style="s2">perfect for us.</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.052" end="00:03:48.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We already have a home.</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.052" end="00:03:49.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A home, Jason, is not just somewhere to</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.212" end="00:03:52.372" style="s2">sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.852" end="00:03:54.492" style="s2">It&#39;s a statement.</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.372" end="00:03:55.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A statement to whom?</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.492" end="00:03:58.477" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.092" end="00:03:58.477" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You ask the strangest questions. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.052" end="00:04:08.814" style="s2">And after [music] the engagement, things</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.654" end="00:04:10.214" style="s2">will become easier. People will finally</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.814" end="00:04:12.054" style="s2">stop treating us like we&#39;re merely</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.214" end="00:04:13.494" style="s2">dating.</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.054" end="00:04:15.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you need other people to recognize</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.494" end="00:04:16.454" style="s2">our relationship before it becomes real</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.014" end="00:04:21.094" style="s2">to you?</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.454" end="00:04:24.454" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course not. Don&#39;t twist my words.</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.094" end="00:04:24.454" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I only asked the question.</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.774" end="00:04:29.574" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I&#39;m answering [music] it. I love</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.814" end="00:04:29.574" style="s2">you, Jason.</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.574" end="00:04:39.214" style="s2">I love the life we&#39;re building.</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.614" end="00:04:42.494" style="s2">I love what we can become together.</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.214" end="00:04:45.774" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about what we are now?</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.494" end="00:04:45.774" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re overthinking again.</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.494" end="00:04:51.734" style="s2">I have to meet my stylist. Don&#39;t forget</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.254" end="00:04:51.734" style="s2">the celebration is next week.</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.063" end="00:04:58.083" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.648" end="00:05:02.668" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.334" end="00:05:07.974" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello, Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.654" end="00:05:13.854" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sound tired.</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.214" end="00:05:20.454" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am fine, Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.174" end="00:05:20.454" style="s2">Work has been demanding.</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.334" end="00:05:27.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Work will always be demanding.</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.054" end="00:05:28.694" style="s2">You must learn to live somewhere between</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.014" end="00:05:31.494" style="s2">your responsibilities [music] and your</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.694" end="00:05:31.494" style="s2">happiness.</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.614" end="00:05:37.574" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sound like you&#39;re about to give me a</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.134" end="00:05:37.574" style="s2">You&#39;re about to give me a lecture.</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.614" end="00:05:43.934" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am your mother.</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.854" end="00:05:45.188" style="s2">Lecturing you is one of my lifelong</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.934" end="00:05:47.208" style="s2">privileges.</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.188" end="00:05:47.208" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.854" end="00:05:53.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now tell me,</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.654" end="00:05:55.654" style="s2">when am I meeting the woman who has</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.414" end="00:05:56.979" style="s2">managed to keep you occupied for so</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.654" end="00:05:58.999" style="s2">long?</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.979" end="00:05:58.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.974" end="00:06:08.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Actually, that&#39;s why I wanted calling</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.575" end="00:06:08.495" style="s2">earlier, before Victoria came in.</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.335" end="00:06:14.255" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.375" end="00:06:14.255" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing bad.</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.295" end="00:06:17.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason.</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.295" end="00:06:20.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.295" end="00:06:22.655" style="s2">Victoria and I have decided to get</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.095" end="00:06:22.655" style="s2">married.</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.775" end="00:06:29.655" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Married?</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.975" end="00:06:32.615" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.895" end="00:06:40.015" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are serious.</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.895" end="00:06:44.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very serious.</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.535" end="00:06:54.615" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god.</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.855" end="00:06:54.615" style="s2">My son is getting married.</p>
<p begin="00:06:59.415" end="00:07:05.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, please don&#39;t cry.</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.455" end="00:07:07.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am not crying. I am simply allowing my</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.335" end="00:07:08.895" style="s2">face to [music] express what my mouth</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.135" end="00:07:10.735" style="s2">cannot.</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.895" end="00:07:12.375" style="s2">When is the celebration?</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.735" end="00:07:14.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Next Saturday.</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.375" end="00:07:15.415" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Next Saturday? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.135" end="00:07:17.735" style="s2">Jason.</p>
<p begin="00:07:15.415" end="00:07:18.935" style="s2">That is hardly enough time.</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.735" end="00:07:20.255" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The wedding is not next [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.935" end="00:07:22.975" style="s2">Saturday.</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.255" end="00:07:25.815" style="s2">That&#39;s the engagement celebration.</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.975" end="00:07:29.175" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care. [music] I have to come.</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.815" end="00:07:29.175" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course you have to come.</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.415" end="00:07:32.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And don&#39;t send [music] a car to pick me</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.895" end="00:07:33.375" style="s2">up. I&#39;ll arrange everything myself.</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.735" end="00:07:36.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.375" end="00:07:37.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No arguments. This is my only son. I</p>
<p begin="00:07:36.135" end="00:07:40.575" style="s2">have imagined [music] this day more</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.535" end="00:07:40.575" style="s2">times than you know.</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.815" end="00:07:45.015" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wish Dad were here.</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.775" end="00:07:48.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So do I.</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.855" end="00:07:55.135" style="s2">He would have been very proud of you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.015" end="00:07:56.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hope I can make you both [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.135" end="00:07:59.855" style="s2">proud.</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.295" end="00:07:59.855" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You already have, my son.</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.535" end="00:08:03.935" style="s2">Tell Victoria I look forward to meeting</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.255" end="00:08:06.575" style="s2">her properly.</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.935" end="00:08:06.575" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You will.</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.057" end="00:08:35.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your grandmother wore this on her</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.537" end="00:08:38.137" style="s2">wedding day.</p>
<p begin="00:08:35.697" end="00:08:40.857" style="s2">Now it is time for the next woman in our</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.137" end="00:08:40.857" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.697" end="00:09:08.697" style="s2">Carmela. Mr. Okafor says the family will</p>
<p begin="00:09:06.897" end="00:09:10.817" style="s2">have visitors this evening. Make sure</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.697" end="00:09:13.257" style="s2">the kitchen is ready. All right. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.817" end="00:09:14.657" style="s2">prepare extra stock. You always think</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.257" end="00:09:16.377" style="s2">ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.657" end="00:09:18.066" style="s2">Food tastes better when you don&#39;t panic</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.377" end="00:09:20.086" style="s2">at the last minute.</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.066" end="00:09:20.086" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.926" end="00:09:27.946" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:40.977" end="00:09:44.577" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Carmela.</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.857" end="00:09:46.137" style="s2">Good morning, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.577" end="00:09:48.697" style="s2">Good morning.</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.137" end="00:09:51.577" style="s2">How is the preparation?</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.697" end="00:09:51.577" style="s2">Almost ready.</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.577" end="00:09:56.497" style="s2">Good. Mr. Alexander has a demanding</p>
<p begin="00:09:54.457" end="00:09:58.177" style="s2">schedule today. He may return earlier</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.497" end="00:10:01.457" style="s2">than expected.</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.177" end="00:10:01.457" style="s2">I&#39;ll have everything ready.</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.617" end="00:10:05.777" style="s2">You have been doing good work here.</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.137" end="00:10:07.898" style="s2">Thank you, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.777" end="00:10:09.978" style="s2">Don&#39;t thank me. Continue doing what you</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.898" end="00:10:09.978" style="s2">do.</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.378" end="00:10:19.338" style="s2">Move the meeting to 11. I&#39;ll review the</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.298" end="00:10:19.338" style="s2">documents before then.</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.578" end="00:10:25.498" style="s2">Good morning.</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.698" end="00:10:26.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.498" end="00:10:28.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to look frightened every</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.818" end="00:10:31.378" style="s2">time I enter a room.</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.818" end="00:10:32.658" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not frightened, [music] sir.</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.378" end="00:10:36.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why do you look as though I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.658" end="00:10:36.098" style="s2">caught you doing something wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.498" end="00:10:40.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m only making sure [music] breakfast</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.898" end="00:10:43.098" style="s2">is ready.</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.218" end="00:10:45.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And it smells excellent.</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.098" end="00:10:45.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.538" end="00:10:51.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s that?</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.618" end="00:10:52.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing important. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.098" end="00:10:55.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If it were nothing important, you</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.458" end="00:10:58.458" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t be hiding it.</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.298" end="00:11:00.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s just [music] a recipe notebook.</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.458" end="00:11:02.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You write your recipes down?</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.418" end="00:11:02.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The ones I create myself.</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.212" end="00:11:04.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.498" end="00:11:05.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I write everything down so I can</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.018" end="00:11:06.698" style="s2">improve.</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.338" end="00:11:08.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s sensible.</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.698" end="00:11:10.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hope so.</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.938" end="00:11:12.978" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that your own recipe?</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.538" end="00:11:15.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The pepper sauces. The rest is [music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.978" end="00:11:16.778" style="s2">ordinary breakfast.</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.018" end="00:11:19.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But you know, ordinary breakfast can</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.778" end="00:11:19.618" style="s2">still be good.</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.938" end="00:11:30.778" style="s2">I have to go. Thank you, Carmela.</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.778" end="00:11:30.778" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My pleasure, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.753" end="00:11:48.773" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.373" end="00:11:51.393" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.138" end="00:11:59.378" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You saw the [singing and music] clothes</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.298" end="00:12:02.498" style="s2">I wore</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.378" end="00:12:05.378" style="s2">but never saw my name.</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.498" end="00:12:05.378" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect.</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.538" end="00:12:13.139" style="s2">The neckline is too simple. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.458" end="00:12:15.779" style="s2">You asked for elegance. Elegance doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.139" end="00:12:17.179" style="s2">mean ordinary.</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.779" end="00:12:19.139" style="s2">I want something people [music] will</p>
<p begin="00:12:17.179" end="00:12:22.019" style="s2">remember.</p>
<p begin="00:12:19.139" end="00:12:25.179" style="s2">People will remember this gown.</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.019" end="00:12:25.179" style="s2">Will they remember me?</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.219" end="00:12:30.638" style="s2">Add more detail around the shoulders.</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.219" end="00:12:32.658" style="s2">Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.638" end="00:12:32.658" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:35.878" end="00:12:37.898" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.463" end="00:12:42.779" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.619" end="00:12:46.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello, darling.</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.779" end="00:12:50.379" style="s2">How is the future Mrs. Alexander?</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.099" end="00:12:53.339" style="s2">Busy becoming unforgettable.</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.379" end="00:12:55.619" style="s2">I hope Jason is behaving himself.</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.339" end="00:12:57.939" style="s2">Jason is Jason. He thinks money should</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.619" end="00:12:59.458" style="s2">solve problems quietly. And you think</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.939" end="00:13:01.478" style="s2">money should make an entrance.</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.458" end="00:13:01.478" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.339" end="00:13:08.979" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone has to make life interesting.</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.539" end="00:13:08.979" style="s2">Have you met his mother yet?</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.979" end="00:13:15.219" style="s2">Not properly.</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.139" end="00:13:17.939" style="s2">You haven&#39;t met her at all? We have</p>
<p begin="00:13:15.219" end="00:13:19.764" style="s2">spoken on the phone.</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.939" end="00:13:20.259" style="s2">That&#39;s not the same thing.</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.764" end="00:13:22.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.259" end="00:13:24.659" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. Jason says she&#39;s private. She</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.899" end="00:13:27.019" style="s2">spends most of her time traveling. She</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.659" end="00:13:29.339" style="s2">is handling business. Well, make sure</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.019" end="00:13:30.459" style="s2">she likes you. Mothers can complicate</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.339" end="00:13:33.299" style="s2">things.</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.459" end="00:13:35.484" style="s2">She will like me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.299" end="00:13:35.579" style="s2">You&#39;re very confident.</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.484" end="00:13:38.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.579" end="00:13:41.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m marrying her only son. She has every</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.139" end="00:13:41.259" style="s2">reason to like me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.859" end="00:13:46.739" style="s2">Everything has to be perfect.</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.964" end="00:13:49.059" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.739" end="00:13:50.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The necklace Jason promised me, is it</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.059" end="00:13:53.779" style="s2">ready?</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.739" end="00:13:56.379" style="s2">I thought he was arranging that himself.</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.779" end="00:14:00.019" style="s2">He is.</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.379" end="00:14:00.019" style="s2">It will be worth waiting for.</p>
<p begin="00:14:08.889" end="00:14:10.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.099" end="00:14:16.461" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.219" end="00:14:19.221" style="s2">have you booked your flight?</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.461" end="00:14:20.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, I will arrive in Lagos on Saturday</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.221" end="00:14:22.501" style="s2">morning.</p>
<p begin="00:14:20.421" end="00:14:24.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s cutting it close.</p>
<p begin="00:14:22.501" end="00:14:26.621" style="s2">You should come on Friday.</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.621" end="00:14:28.461" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have a meeting on Friday. I&#39;ll finish</p>
<p begin="00:14:26.621" end="00:14:29.941" style="s2">it and travel afterward.</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.461" end="00:14:32.461" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll send a driver.</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.941" end="00:14:34.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You will do no such thing.</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.461" end="00:14:36.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.421" end="00:14:39.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I am perfectly capable of</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.701" end="00:14:41.501" style="s2">arranging my own transport.</p>
<p begin="00:14:39.021" end="00:14:43.381" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, you&#39;re impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:14:41.501" end="00:14:44.915" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And yet you love me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.381" end="00:14:46.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Unfortunately.</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.915" end="00:14:48.941" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.701" end="00:14:51.981" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell me something. Does Victoria know</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.941" end="00:14:51.981" style="s2">about the necklace?</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.101" end="00:14:56.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.301" end="00:14:58.541" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. It is a surprise.</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.901" end="00:15:01.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to bring an expensive</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.541" end="00:15:03.261" style="s2">gift.</p>
<p begin="00:15:01.101" end="00:15:05.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am not bringing it because [music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:03.261" end="00:15:07.840" style="s2">it is expensive.</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.621" end="00:15:10.941" style="s2">I am bringing it because it means</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.840" end="00:15:10.941" style="s2">[music] something.</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.061" end="00:15:15.461" style="s2">My mother gave it to me when I married</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.781" end="00:15:17.421" style="s2">your father. She told me jewelry is only</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.461" end="00:15:20.301" style="s2">beautiful when the person wearing it</p>
<p begin="00:15:17.421" end="00:15:22.541" style="s2">understands what it represents.</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.301" end="00:15:23.741" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what does it represent?</p>
<p begin="00:15:22.541" end="00:15:25.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Love,</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.741" end="00:15:26.941" style="s2">responsibility,</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.701" end="00:15:28.901" style="s2">and the understanding that being</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.941" end="00:15:30.021" style="s2">welcomed into a family is a privilege,</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.901" end="00:15:33.021" style="s2">not a competition.</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.021" end="00:15:33.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hope so, too.</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.181" end="00:15:39.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will see you soon, my son.</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.941" end="00:15:42.941" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Travel safely.</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.701" end="00:15:58.781" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have grown into a good man.</p>
<p begin="00:16:01.901" end="00:16:06.301" style="s2">Now I pray you choose a good woman.</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.306" end="00:16:17.326" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:20.546" end="00:16:22.566" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.342" end="00:16:38.262" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, traffic is building ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.142" end="00:16:39.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How long before we reach the [music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.262" end="00:16:43.462" style="s2">hotel?</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.702" end="00:16:46.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe 30 minutes, depending on the road.</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.462" end="00:16:46.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.422" end="00:16:49.862" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam?</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.862" end="00:16:53.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it?</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.982" end="00:16:59.182" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think something is wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.582" end="00:17:05.022" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you fix it?</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.262" end="00:17:05.022" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me check, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.702" end="00:17:10.822" style="s2">Madam, the engine has a problem. I need</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.822" end="00:17:10.822" style="s2">to call a mechanic.</p>
<p begin="00:17:10.902" end="00:17:16.382" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How long will that take?</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.502" end="00:17:16.382" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I cannot say.</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.182" end="00:17:21.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call someone nearby. I don&#39;t want us</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.862" end="00:17:21.702" style="s2">stranded here.</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.142" end="00:17:33.622" style="s2">Hello, my son.</p>
<p begin="00:17:32.302" end="00:17:35.782" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are you?</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.622" end="00:17:37.222" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On the road. The car has developed a</p>
<p begin="00:17:35.782" end="00:17:38.742" style="s2">problem.</p>
<p begin="00:17:37.222" end="00:17:40.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.742" end="00:17:42.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. The driver is arranging a</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.742" end="00:17:44.302" style="s2">mechanic.</p>
<p begin="00:17:42.622" end="00:17:46.062" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Send me your location. I&#39;ll send someone</p>
<p begin="00:17:44.302" end="00:17:48.382" style="s2">immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.062" end="00:17:50.782" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason, I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.382" end="00:17:53.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, it&#39;s raining.</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.782" end="00:17:56.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can see that.</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.142" end="00:17:56.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please don&#39;t argue with me right now.</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.502" end="00:18:02.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, I&#39;ll send it.</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.347" end="00:18:07.367" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.262" end="00:18:24.063" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Driver, where are you going?</p>
<p begin="00:18:21.583" end="00:18:25.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, there is a workshop ahead. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.063" end="00:18:28.983" style="s2">ask them to come.</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.823" end="00:18:28.983" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let me stay here.</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.703" end="00:18:48.503" style="s2">What a day.</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.433" end="00:19:17.453" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.863" end="00:19:27.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good afternoon, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.903" end="00:19:29.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good afternoon.</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.543" end="00:19:32.143" style="s2">Are you all right? My car broke down a</p>
<p begin="00:19:29.903" end="00:19:33.463" style="s2">little farther down the road.</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.143" end="00:19:35.103" style="s2">The driver has gone to look for a</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.463" end="00:19:36.463" style="s2">mechanic.</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.103" end="00:19:38.943" style="s2">And you&#39;ve been standing here in the</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.463" end="00:19:38.943" style="s2">rain?</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.463" end="00:19:43.463" style="s2">I was trying to find somewhere to wait.</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.223" end="00:19:48.663" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is a house just around the corner.</p>
<p begin="00:19:46.903" end="00:19:50.623" style="s2">It belongs to my family. You can come</p>
<p begin="00:19:48.663" end="00:19:54.063" style="s2">inside until the rain reduces.</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.623" end="00:19:57.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, no. I don&#39;t want to disturb you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.063" end="00:19:59.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not disturbing me.</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.103" end="00:20:01.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t even know you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.823" end="00:20:04.463" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to know someone before</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.303" end="00:20:04.463" style="s2">offering them shelter.</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.943" end="00:20:14.383" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you sure?</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.783" end="00:20:14.383" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, ma. I am sure.</p>
<p begin="00:20:14.623" end="00:20:18.943" style="s2">Please, the rain is getting heavier.</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.665" end="00:20:33.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to do that. It&#39;s all</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.465" end="00:20:35.865" style="s2">right.</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.905" end="00:20:37.545" style="s2">You might get wet yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.865" end="00:20:40.785" style="s2">I&#39;m already wet.</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.545" end="00:20:40.785" style="s2">I didn&#39;t know it&#39;s going to rain.</p>
<p begin="00:20:57.865" end="00:21:00.905" style="s2">Please sit here, Ma.</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.025" end="00:21:12.065" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.265" end="00:21:13.825" style="s2">I&#39;ll get you something dry.</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.065" end="00:21:15.465" style="s2">Your home is lovely.</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.825" end="00:21:17.505" style="s2">It&#39;s small, that doesn&#39;t make it any</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.465" end="00:21:20.385" style="s2">less lovely.</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.505" end="00:21:20.385" style="s2">I&#39;ll be right back.</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.585" end="00:21:38.305" style="s2">This dress should fit you. It belongs to</p>
<p begin="00:21:36.585" end="00:21:40.785" style="s2">my aunt, but she left it here when she</p>
<p begin="00:21:38.305" end="00:21:43.305" style="s2">traveled.</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.785" end="00:21:44.785" style="s2">I cannot take your clothes.</p>
<p begin="00:21:43.305" end="00:21:48.145" style="s2">You&#39;re not taking them, you&#39;re borrowing</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.785" end="00:21:49.585" style="s2">them. You are very kind.</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.145" end="00:21:52.185" style="s2">Please, Ma, you need to get out of those</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.585" end="00:21:53.985" style="s2">wet clothes before you catch a cold.</p>
<p begin="00:21:52.185" end="00:21:55.705" style="s2">All right.</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.985" end="00:21:58.985" style="s2">You can change in there.</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.705" end="00:21:58.985" style="s2">I&#39;ll prepare something warm.</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.986" end="00:22:36.586" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please drink this while it&#39;s warm.</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.466" end="00:22:43.506" style="s2">You have already done too much. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:22:40.746" end="00:22:43.506" style="s2">only tea.</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.946" end="00:22:50.746" style="s2">That is exactly what I needed. May I ask</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.466" end="00:22:53.106" style="s2">your name? Camilla, Camilla Chijioke.</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.746" end="00:22:55.746" style="s2">I&#39;m Evelyn.</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.106" end="00:22:56.946" style="s2">Evelyn Alexander. It&#39;s nice to meet you,</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.746" end="00:22:58.946" style="s2">ma.</p>
<p begin="00:22:56.946" end="00:23:00.186" style="s2">And how old are you, Camilla?</p>
<p begin="00:22:58.946" end="00:23:02.226" style="s2">24.</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.186" end="00:23:04.346" style="s2">Do you live here with your family? Yes,</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.226" end="00:23:05.906" style="s2">my mother and I. What do you do? I cook</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.346" end="00:23:08.426" style="s2">for people, small events, family</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.906" end="00:23:11.546" style="s2">gatherings.</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.426" end="00:23:13.186" style="s2">You enjoy it? Very much.</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.546" end="00:23:16.266" style="s2">Then why do you look worried whenever</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.186" end="00:23:16.266" style="s2">you talk about it?</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.426" end="00:23:21.946" style="s2">Because enjoying something and being</p>
<p begin="00:23:19.586" end="00:23:24.186" style="s2">able to live comfortably from it</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.946" end="00:23:25.786" style="s2">are two different things.</p>
<p begin="00:23:24.186" end="00:23:28.426" style="s2">I want to have my own food business</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.786" end="00:23:30.026" style="s2">someday. Nothing too big at first, just</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.426" end="00:23:31.946" style="s2">a clean place where people can eat good</p>
<p begin="00:23:30.026" end="00:23:34.466" style="s2">food without spending all their money.</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.946" end="00:23:37.066" style="s2">wonderful.</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.466" end="00:23:39.426" style="s2">I have recipes I want to try, ideas for</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.066" end="00:23:40.826" style="s2">the menu, even a name.</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.426" end="00:23:43.826" style="s2">What is the name?</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.826" end="00:23:45.706" style="s2">I&#39;m still deciding.</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.826" end="00:23:47.186" style="s2">Then you are already further along than</p>
<p begin="00:23:45.706" end="00:23:49.266" style="s2">you think.</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.186" end="00:23:51.946" style="s2">You have a dream and you are working</p>
<p begin="00:23:49.266" end="00:23:51.946" style="s2">toward it.</p>
<p begin="00:23:52.346" end="00:23:55.546" style="s2">Sometimes I wonder if it will ever</p>
<p begin="00:23:54.026" end="00:23:57.306" style="s2">happen.</p>
<p begin="00:23:55.546" end="00:24:01.226" style="s2">Don&#39;t allow a difficult beginning to</p>
<p begin="00:23:57.306" end="00:24:01.226" style="s2">convince you that you have no future.</p>
<p begin="00:24:02.186" end="00:24:09.186" style="s2">Tell me something. Why did you help me?</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.866" end="00:24:09.186" style="s2">Because you needed help.</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.706" end="00:24:15.506" style="s2">You didn&#39;t ask who I was. Would it have</p>
<p begin="00:24:13.826" end="00:24:17.386" style="s2">changed anything? You were standing in</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.506" end="00:24:18.826" style="s2">the rain, your car had broken down, you</p>
<p begin="00:24:17.386" end="00:24:21.746" style="s2">were uncomfortable and needed somewhere</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.826" end="00:24:24.866" style="s2">to sit. I could help, so I helped. I</p>
<p begin="00:24:21.746" end="00:24:26.307" style="s2">hope life rewards that heart of yours.</p>
<p begin="00:24:24.866" end="00:24:28.347" style="s2">I didn&#39;t help you because I wanted a</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.307" end="00:24:30.908" style="s2">reward.</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.347" end="00:24:30.908" style="s2">I know.</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.908" end="00:24:37.788" style="s2">Ma, I need to leave for work soon, but</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.187" end="00:24:39.227" style="s2">I&#39;ll help you arrange transport before I</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.788" end="00:24:41.268" style="s2">go.</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.227" end="00:24:42.627" style="s2">You have already done enough.</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.268" end="00:24:45.627" style="s2">Let me at least make sure you get</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.627" end="00:24:45.627" style="s2">somewhere safe.</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.507" end="00:24:51.668" style="s2">Hm.</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.347" end="00:24:59.367" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.172" end="00:25:09.192" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.307" end="00:25:13.722" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The partnership gives us access to three</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.547" end="00:25:14.827" style="s2">additional distribution networks.</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.722" end="00:25:17.067" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.827" end="00:25:20.347" style="s2">It also reduces our exposure to the</p>
<p begin="00:25:17.067" end="00:25:20.347" style="s2">northern supply route.</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.388" end="00:25:23.747" style="s2">What are the liabilities? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.427" end="00:25:25.908" style="s2">Manageable.</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.747" end="00:25:27.947" style="s2">That is not a number.</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.908" end="00:25:29.547" style="s2">The projected risk is within acceptable</p>
<p begin="00:25:27.947" end="00:25:31.268" style="s2">limits.</p>
<p begin="00:25:29.547" end="00:25:32.987" style="s2">Who verified the assumptions? Our</p>
<p begin="00:25:31.268" end="00:25:34.627" style="s2">finance team. And the external [music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.987" end="00:25:35.827" style="s2">assessment?</p>
<p begin="00:25:34.627" end="00:25:37.107" style="s2">We are still waiting for the final</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.827" end="00:25:39.547" style="s2">report.</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.107" end="00:25:41.232" style="s2">Then the proposal is not ready.</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.547" end="00:25:42.867" style="s2">Jason, the board wants a decision this</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.232" end="00:25:44.867" style="s2">[music] week.</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.867" end="00:25:46.507" style="s2">The board can wait until we know what we</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.867" end="00:25:49.227" style="s2">are approving.</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.507" end="00:25:49.227" style="s2">Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:25:58.388" end="00:26:02.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:26:01.148" end="00:26:03.987" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need you to [music] locate my mother.</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.547" end="00:26:04.947" style="s2">Her car broke down somewhere along the</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.987" end="00:26:05.587" style="s2">expressway.</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.947" end="00:26:07.467" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.587" end="00:26:09.388" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Contact the driver she traveled with.</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.467" end="00:26:11.067" style="s2">Find out exactly where she is.</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.388" end="00:26:12.268" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll do that immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.067" end="00:26:14.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is everything all right?</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.268" end="00:26:15.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mother is stranded on the road.</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.107" end="00:26:17.788" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you need me to arrange anything?</p>
<p begin="00:26:15.827" end="00:26:18.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve already sent someone.</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.788" end="00:26:21.707" style="s2">I hope she&#39;s safe.</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.947" end="00:26:21.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hope so, too.</p>
<p begin="00:26:22.498" end="00:26:24.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.547" end="00:26:31.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh.</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.013" end="00:26:33.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.427" end="00:26:35.653" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank goodness the rain has finally</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.509" end="00:26:35.653" style="s2">stopped. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.869" end="00:26:48.789" style="s2">Please eat something before you leave.</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.069" end="00:26:55.709" style="s2">You are determined to feed me.</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.749" end="00:26:55.709" style="s2">It&#39;s what I do.</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.178" end="00:27:03.949" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:27:00.789" end="00:27:03.949" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can see that.</p>
<p begin="00:27:09.629" end="00:27:12.349" style="s2">Hello, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.589" end="00:27:15.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Camilla, what is your estimated arrival</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.589" end="00:27:17.349" style="s2">time?</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.629" end="00:27:20.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry, sir. [music] Something came</p>
<p begin="00:27:17.349" end="00:27:23.309" style="s2">up, but I&#39;ll be on my way shortly.</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.749" end="00:27:26.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The guests are expected soon.</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.309" end="00:27:30.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand. Everything will be ready.</p>
<p begin="00:27:26.909" end="00:27:30.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very well. Please don&#39;t delay.</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.629" end="00:27:36.269" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you going to lose your job because</p>
<p begin="00:27:35.109" end="00:27:38.789" style="s2">of me?</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.269" end="00:27:42.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.789" end="00:27:42.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sound uncertain.</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.109" end="00:27:45.989" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want to disappoint my employer,</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.989" end="00:27:47.949" style="s2">but I will still make sure your</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.989" end="00:27:51.349" style="s2">transport is certain.</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.949" end="00:27:52.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can arrange everything myself now.</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.349" end="00:27:54.909" style="s2">Are you sure?</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.309" end="00:27:54.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.629" end="00:27:59.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, where have you been?</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.829" end="00:28:01.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry, my son. My phone was almost</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.909" end="00:28:02.269" style="s2">out of power.</p>
<p begin="00:28:01.229" end="00:28:04.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you safe?</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.269" end="00:28:06.989" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. A young woman helped me. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.679" end="00:28:08.429" style="s2">[music] with her now.</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.989" end="00:28:11.069" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are you?</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.429" end="00:28:12.669" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will send you the address.</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.069" end="00:28:15.069" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll come and get you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.669" end="00:28:16.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, Jason. I can take a car to the</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.069" end="00:28:17.269" style="s2">venue.</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.149" end="00:28:19.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, please.</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.269" end="00:28:21.469" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am safe. I have eaten, I have dry</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.709" end="00:28:23.069" style="s2">clothes, and I am no longer standing in</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.469" end="00:28:24.869" style="s2">the rain. You have an engagement</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.069" end="00:28:25.909" style="s2">celebration to attend. Finish your</p>
<p begin="00:28:24.869" end="00:28:28.669" style="s2">preparations.</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.909" end="00:28:30.879" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.669" end="00:28:32.189" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have mentioned that.</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.879" end="00:28:32.844" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.189" end="00:28:33.389" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.844" end="00:28:36.110" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.389" end="00:28:38.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least let me arrange a car.</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.110" end="00:28:41.270" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That would be helpful. We are at 49</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.310" end="00:28:44.950" style="s2">Crystal Avenue.</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.270" end="00:28:44.950" style="s2">My son is sending a car.</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.990" end="00:28:52.030" style="s2">That is good.</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.830" end="00:28:53.790" style="s2">Thank you, Camilla. I will never forget</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.030" end="00:28:55.230" style="s2">what you have done for me.</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.790" end="00:28:57.734" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to remember it forever,</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.230" end="00:28:59.754" style="s2">Ma. Just get home safely.</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.734" end="00:28:59.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.390" end="00:29:06.470" style="s2">&gt;&gt; May God bless you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.870" end="00:29:06.470" style="s2">Amen.</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.910" end="00:29:12.145" style="s2">I have to leave now.</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.550" end="00:29:12.190" style="s2">Go.</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.145" end="00:29:15.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.190" end="00:29:15.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And don&#39;t worry about me.</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.190" end="00:29:19.430" style="s2">Ma?</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.270" end="00:29:20.790" style="s2">Yes? If the car doesn&#39;t arrive soon,</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.430" end="00:29:23.390" style="s2">please call me. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.790" end="00:29:23.390" style="s2">I will.</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.895" end="00:29:46.915" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.445" end="00:29:54.030" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.670" end="00:29:57.390" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you so much for coming. Please</p>
<p begin="00:29:54.030" end="00:29:57.390" style="s2">make yourself comfortable.</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.190" end="00:30:05.230" style="s2">You haven&#39;t smiled in 20 minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.190" end="00:30:07.390" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m smiling now.</p>
<p begin="00:30:05.230" end="00:30:09.830" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not a smile. That&#39;s a photograph.</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.390" end="00:30:11.270" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m waiting for my mother.</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.830" end="00:30:12.470" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is she still coming? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.270" end="00:30:15.030" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:30:12.470" end="00:30:16.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I only ask because she hasn&#39;t arrived.</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.030" end="00:30:18.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her car broke down. She was safe the</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.910" end="00:30:20.830" style="s2">last time we spoke.</p>
<p begin="00:30:18.750" end="00:30:22.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her car broke down?</p>
<p begin="00:30:20.830" end="00:30:23.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.550" end="00:30:25.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Couldn&#39;t she have taken another [music]</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.710" end="00:30:28.510" style="s2">car?</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.110" end="00:30:28.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She has arranged transport.</p>
<p begin="00:30:30.390" end="00:30:32.711" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, I hope she arrives before the</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.750" end="00:30:33.070" style="s2">photographs.</p>
<p begin="00:30:32.711" end="00:30:35.030" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.070" end="00:30:36.672" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s my mother, Victoria. I&#39;m more</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.030" end="00:30:40.231" style="s2">concerned about her being safe than</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.672" end="00:30:40.231" style="s2">whether she appears in the photographs.</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.152" end="00:30:45.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t say [music] otherwise.</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.472" end="00:30:51.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome. We&#39;re so glad you could make</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.912" end="00:30:51.392" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.291" end="00:30:58.311" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.272" end="00:31:19.472" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good evening, ma&#39;am. Do you have an</p>
<p begin="00:31:18.512" end="00:31:22.152" style="s2">invitation?</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.472" end="00:31:25.272" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. I am here for Jason Alexander&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:31:22.152" end="00:31:28.672" style="s2">engagement celebration.</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.272" end="00:31:28.672" style="s2">&gt;&gt; May I see your invitation, ma&#39;am?</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.552" end="00:31:45.672" style="s2">All right, ma&#39;am. You may proceed.</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.152" end="00:31:45.672" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A dress is only a dress.</p>
<p begin="00:31:53.931" end="00:31:57.072" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.231" end="00:31:59.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am so glad you could make it.</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.072" end="00:32:01.847" style="s2">Enjoy the evening.</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.827" end="00:32:01.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:05.722" end="00:32:07.742" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.752" end="00:32:20.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is this?</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.832" end="00:32:20.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, I&#39;m so sorry. I didn&#39;t see you turn.</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.552" end="00:32:27.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you blind? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.152" end="00:32:29.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I sincerely apologize. My car broke down</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.912" end="00:32:32.352" style="s2">in the rain, and</p>
<p begin="00:32:29.592" end="00:32:35.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care what happened to your car.</p>
<p begin="00:32:32.352" end="00:32:37.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, let me explain.</p>
<p begin="00:32:35.392" end="00:32:39.272" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Explain what?</p>
<p begin="00:32:37.552" end="00:32:40.993" style="s2">Look at my dress.</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.272" end="00:32:42.513" style="s2">Do you have any idea how much this</p>
<p begin="00:32:40.993" end="00:32:45.153" style="s2">costs? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.513" end="00:32:48.673" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand that it is expensive.</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.153" end="00:32:48.673" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You understand nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:32:48.953" end="00:32:52.393" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry for the stain. It was an</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.993" end="00:32:55.233" style="s2">accident.</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.393" end="00:32:58.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; People like you always have an excuse.</p>
<p begin="00:32:55.233" end="00:32:58.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; People like me?</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.793" end="00:33:01.953" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.433" end="00:33:07.433" style="s2">Who is that woman?</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.473" end="00:33:11.353" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.713" end="00:33:15.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is a private engagement</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.353" end="00:33:16.673" style="s2">celebration, not a public shelter.</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.313" end="00:33:18.313" style="s2">Young woman,</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.673" end="00:33:20.447" style="s2">you should be careful how you speak to</p>
<p begin="00:33:18.313" end="00:33:20.447" style="s2">people. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.833" end="00:33:24.913" style="s2">Or what?</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.273" end="00:33:27.673" style="s2">You may be mistaken about who you are</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.913" end="00:33:29.673" style="s2">speaking to.</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.673" end="00:33:32.513" style="s2">Oh, really?</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.673" end="00:33:35.793" style="s2">My name [music] is Evelyn Alexander.</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.513" end="00:33:35.793" style="s2">I am Jason&#39;s mother.</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.673" end="00:33:42.993" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jason&#39;s mother? Jason&#39;s mother?</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.873" end="00:33:46.593" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:33:42.993" end="00:33:46.593" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You expect me to believe that?</p>
<p begin="00:33:47.433" end="00:33:51.553" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am not asking you to believe anything</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.433" end="00:33:53.273" style="s2">except the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:33:51.553" end="00:33:57.153" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you know how many women have tried to</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.273" end="00:33:57.153" style="s2">get close to Jason because of his money?</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.433" end="00:34:00.233" style="s2">And now you think you can walk into my</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.833" end="00:34:02.193" style="s2">engagement celebration wearing that</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.233" end="00:34:03.313" style="s2">dress and pretend to be his mother? Are</p>
<p begin="00:34:02.193" end="00:34:04.713" style="s2">you not one of those ladies who wants to</p>
<p begin="00:34:03.313" end="00:34:07.233" style="s2">steal my man?</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.713" end="00:34:10.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t need to pretend to be anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.233" end="00:34:10.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are a liar.</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.593" end="00:34:13.673" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have offered you an explanation. You</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.433" end="00:34:15.393" style="s2">have chosen to insult [music] me</p>
<p begin="00:34:13.673" end="00:34:17.673" style="s2">instead.</p>
<p begin="00:34:15.393" end="00:34:19.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out of my way.</p>
<p begin="00:34:17.673" end="00:34:21.593" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will not leave until I speak to</p>
<p begin="00:34:19.343" end="00:34:23.753" style="s2">[music] my son.</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.593" end="00:34:27.393" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You will not ruin this day for me.</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.753" end="00:34:27.393" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then stop ruining it yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.673" end="00:34:41.753" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is what you get [music] for</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.633" end="00:34:41.753" style="s2">disrespecting me.</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.073" end="00:34:45.434" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You slapped me.</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.754" end="00:34:47.594" style="s2">You deserved [music] it.</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.434" end="00:34:51.394" style="s2">You have made a very serious mistake.</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.594" end="00:34:51.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm. Get security.</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.554" end="00:34:56.474" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch me.</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.229" end="00:35:05.249" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell]</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.019" end="00:35:17.039" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.639" end="00:35:19.659" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.314" end="00:35:27.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You saw the clothes [music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:35:25.554" end="00:35:30.754" style="s2">I wore.</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.594" end="00:35:33.554" style="s2">Then they were sewn on me.</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.754" end="00:35:37.114" style="s2">You judged me at the door [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.554" end="00:35:38.634" style="s2">before you knew a thing.</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.114" end="00:35:40.354" style="s2">You measured me [music and singing] by</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.634" end="00:35:43.184" style="s2">what you saw.</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.354" end="00:35:43.594" style="s2">You built your pride. You made your law.</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.184" end="00:35:46.459" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.594" end="00:35:49.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You held your head up to the sky and</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.459" end="00:35:52.034" style="s2">[singing] never asked the reason why.</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.954" end="00:35:53.194" style="s2">You thought [music] that power made you</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.034" end="00:35:54.974" style="s2">right.</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.194" end="00:35:56.474" style="s2">You thought your gold could blind</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.974" end="00:35:58.874" style="s2">[singing] the light.</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.474" end="00:36:00.514" style="s2">But every heart has [music] a story told</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.874" end="00:36:03.474" style="s2">and every soul [singing] is worth much</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.514" end="00:36:03.474" style="s2">more than gold.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
